      "messageContent": "As discussed in the SIR meeting held at MLA S. Pargat Singh's office, all participants are required to submit details of one Booth Level Agent (BLA) per booth.\n\nPlease find attached the prescribed format (Excel file) for submitting the required information. Along with the filled format, kindly also provide a copy of the Aadhaar Card and two passport-size photographs for each BLA.11:32 am",
